<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">-ƆFM ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Ɔfilimɔ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Ɔfilimɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɔfilimɔ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɔfm</para>
  <para style="mt">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa ƆFILIMƆ</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔfilimɔ akwu u to keyi uwu ɔshɔshi uwu Okolosi, e kyo akwu umɛza uwu Ɔpɔlu tete. Unye uwu Ɔfilimɔ uwu o ya wu tee Onisimu awu, e to eduwo iyi adakwogba wu, Ɔfilimɔ mo mɛlɔ akwɛyi a rɛnya a ka mu Oromu. kwuyengwu e yi mu Oromu mɔmɔ akwɛyi e kpolo Ɔpɔlu akwɛyi a na Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kaa lakwu Ɔkwu wu mbala Usama wu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu a lɔ Onisimu la kwupu kwɔlɛ tee la gba le so mbaa adakwogba wu, Ɔfilimɔ. Ɔpɔlu a kpa Ɔfilimɔ ɛshɛku tee la gbayi la kpa Onisimu ka le to wu tee akwu umɛnɛ mu Okrasi ŋa moo le to wu tee akwu unye uwu bɔkɔ a rɛnya a lafya laa adakwogba wu fo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu kwokpindiri ngwɔlɛ, mbala ungwu Ɛfishiya mbala ungwu Okoloshiya mbala ungwu Ofilipiya o ya yi tee epu iyi ugugyi kwuwongu Ɔpɔlu a ka yi kwuyengwu ɔ ta wu mu ugu mu Oromu (mu kari unga A.D.59-61) awu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛnyigbɛlɛma (1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ipwɔma iyi Ɔfilimɔ (4-7)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛshɛku ikpama iyi Ɔpɔlu kwuwongu Onisimu (8-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi iso (23-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Imi Ɔpɔlu, uwu bɔkɔ mi yi mu ugugyi kwuwongu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi awu, mbala umanyi nzu Otimoti gba ki ka ŋa kwupu kwɔlɛ le,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Ɔfilimɔ umɛza nzu mbala onzu wopo nzu uwu ɛduma, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />mbala ɔshɔshi uwu bɔkɔ a kpala ɛlu mogba ŋa awu, mbala umanyi nzu okokpayi Afiya, mbala Akipu uwu bɔkɔ ki wo ɛduma iyi Ɔkwu kyaa awu:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Ukpo Ete nzu mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le shi yi esheshi mbala idigbomo.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idɛnyi Mbala Ikwidufulo Iyi Ɔfilimɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Umɛnɛ mi Ɔfilimɔ, kwuyengwunanguna bɔkɔ mi lɛ Ukpo, mi to rinyi ŋɔ, akwɛyi mi gbɛlɛ Ukpo mi ɛnyi. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Moo mi pwa mate bɔkɔ ŋɔ pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu umba Ukpo mbala ikwu idu lu fulo iyi ŋɔ yi yi mu Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Mi lɛ Ukpo tee ikpakya nzu iyi kinzu wa mbwalu li bo laa ikyomo mu izɔngɔma iyi esheshi iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ bɔkɔ ki fya mu luzɛ nzu mbala Okrasi. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Umɛnɛ mi, idɛnyi ŋɔ i shi mi ɔnyɛ mbala ɛnwu ɛkɔ gyɔɔ! Ŋɔ ka enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi ɛnwu ma.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwoya Kwuwongwu Onisimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ mi do te mii ta ŋa ɔkpa ka wo kiya ingyi i fa te kaa wo, kwuwongu mi kwu umɛnɛ ŋɔ meka iyi Okrasi. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Imi ba kwuwongu mi pwu idɛnyi ŋɔ le gba mi mate i shemi woshi i ka le awu tee la mi kpa ŋa ɛshɛku le. Imi Ɔpɔlu uwu bɔkɔ mi kwu Ɔsukpo uwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi, bɔkɔ mi yi mu ugu ugyi kwuwo wu kekelele awu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ mii kpa ŋa ɛshɛku kwuwongu Onisimo, uwu bɔkɔ akwu umɛ mi meka iyi Okrasi; moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi yi mu ugugyi awu mi kwu ete wu meka iyi kwundu. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Kwuye kwukpɛnyi e yi ogbo eshi ŋɔ mo, kekelele ba e yi ogbo e shi ŋɔ mbala mi.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Mii gba mi lɔwu mi ka ŋa kekelele, egbo mi ba i yi mbala wu. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Mi gyi tee la ŋɔ mbala mi munɛ, mate bɔkɔ mi yi mu Ugugyi kwuwongu ilɔ iyesheshi ɛlɛ, kaa la mbwa mi ma kunzu ŋɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Tetete, mi gyi tee la mi kpaŋa mɛga kaa mbwami ma mo; mi gyi tee wo yi mu inyama iyi egbo ŋɔ. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi wo kiya kinyinyi te mo, ŋɔ nyama dɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Igbomo Onisimo a lu ŋɔ afyima kwuye bwɛ kwuwongu kaa la gba le bo munyi ŋɔ kaa le yi mbala ŋa iyɔkpɔ le. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Kekelele akwu unye bi fo. a ka unye mo ŋa: akwu umɛnɛ uwu idɛnyi meka iyi Okrasi. Imi mi pwu idɛnyi wu gyɔɔ! Uŋɔ ba pwu idɛnyi wu ka, moo akwu unye a gba akwu umɛnɛ meka iyi Ɔkwu!<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ akwiyi gba ŋɔ to mi tee ki kwu enzu umba ɛduma kya, de ba uŋɔ gba wu la i nama kyamate bɔkɔ ŋɔ na mi tayi. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Akwiyi gba e wo ŋɔ kiya ingyira nana e ri kwokpa ŋa, Imi gba mi wa le. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Imi Ɔpɔlu gba mi ka ɛlɛ le mafyi mi tee, Imi mi wa ŋa kwɔkpa ma. (I fa te la mi lolo ŋɔ ilolomo mo te uŋɔ mafyi ŋɔ ngyɔɔ ŋɔ ra la kwokpa mi.) <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Kwuwongu ɔlɛ, umɛnɛ mi shɔkɔ wo mi iyeshi ɛlɛ ma kwuwongu Ɔkwu; kwuwongu ki kwu imɛnɛ meka iyi Okrasi awu, kaa ka mi ɛnwu ma!<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Imi mi yitu tee, iyi bɔkɔ mi ka ŋa yi ele, uŋɔ ŋɔ wo yi tayi, Imi mi yitu tee uŋɔ lala ŋɔ wo iyi bɔkɔ i ka ɛlɛ ma. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Kekelele te, mi gyi te nɔngɔ ugu kaa she mi, moo mi shi egbo te Ukpo a pwa ɛshɛku ikpama yi lɛɛbi akwɛyi oo wa mi ma mu ugu ugyi o shi yi.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyigbɛlɛma Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafarasi, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu ugu ugyi mbala mi munɛ kwuwongu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi awu, a gbɛlɛ ŋɔ ɛnyi, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Omaki, mbala Arisitaku, mbala Odimasi, mbala Oluku umba bɔkɔ ki wo ɛduma kyaa le, o gbɛlɛ ŋɔ ɛnyi tete.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Esheshi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi li yi mbala yi lɛɛbi.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>